{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nuice Industries is a management/tycoon game with a playful sci-fi take on the oil rush theme. Excel in the race for resources, whether by exercising your management skills, harnessing the unusual weather of this alien planet, or launching both sneaky and violent attacks to sabotage your competitors\u2019 operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876440/extras/d1396ec48e0d4b5debcb3d7d6aa02a58.poster.avif?t=1756915020\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876440/extras/d1396ec48e0d4b5debcb3d7d6aa02a58.webm?t=1756915020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876440/extras/d1396ec48e0d4b5debcb3d7d6aa02a58.mp4?t=1756915020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might be asking, \u201cWhat is Nuice good for anyway? What do these companies do with this highly nuclear material?\u201d Well, we can\u2019t give you that information out of concern for our own personal health. Rest assured, though, that if you manage to buy enough fuel to earn your seat in the shuttle, you won\u2019t have to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876440/extras/648806e2315b7ea6875b12c23e88044e.poster.avif?t=1756915020\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876440/extras/648806e2315b7ea6875b12c23e88044e.webm?t=1756915020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876440/extras/648806e2315b7ea6875b12c23e88044e.mp4?t=1756915020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan and lay down complex piping networks to exploit Nuice, Gold and other resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broaden and develop your Nuice drilling and discovery capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your race against time by keeping Nuice reserves until you find the right moment to cash out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart and outbid your competitors to guarantee your spot among the victors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create profit optimization strategies, such as storing lightning via batteries and enriching your Nuice reserves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode where you set your own parameters.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876440?t=1756915020","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876440?t=1756915020","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876440/2ae96f1366b4af94370e81cfc697b3c96ebfddeb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756915020","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876440/2ae96f1366b4af94370e81cfc697b3c96ebfddeb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756915020","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nuice Industries is a management/tycoon game with a playful sci-fi take on the oil rush theme. Excel 