_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan and lay down complex piping networks to exploit Nuice, Gold and other resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broaden and develop your Nuice drilling and discovery capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your race against time by keeping Nuice reserves until you find the right moment to cash out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart and outbid your competitors to guarantee your spot among the victors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create profit optimization strategies, such as storing lightning via batteries and enriching your Nuice reserves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode where you set your own parameters.</p></li></ul>","developers":["CastleWind"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3518730","name":"Nuice Industries"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876440/b616559311e2f8bf3b25a1d7f3afffecd4460a91/header.jpg?t=1756915020","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192688,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192688/movie480.mp4?t=1756915018","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192688/movie_max.mp4?t=1756915018"},"name":"Nuice Industries Demo Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192688/0d67df8fb8f55e676d93f3316ecad7b667267993/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756915018","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192